{"q":{"g":"In this quest, you have to find the balletmeister's apartment on Streets of Tarkov. The wanted apartment is apartment no. 10 on the fourth floor of the Primorsky 48 apartment building. A Primorsky 46-48 skybridge key is required to enter it via the skybridge from the adjoining Primorsky 46 staircase. The apartment 10 entrance door can be breached from the inside to leave.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/d3/Apartment10Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230825214825","c":"Apartment 10 marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/af/Apartment10Outside.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230108161221","c":"Apartment 10 from outside"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/e/e9/UnderpassKeyMap.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230825214519","c":"Skybridge marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/7/7d/UnderpassKeyUnderpass.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230108161937","c":"The skybridge from the ground"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/1/1b/UnderpassKeyWay1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230102205921","c":"Way to the Primorsky 46 staircase 1"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/2/2b/UnderpassKeyWay2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230102205914","c":"Way to the Primorsky 46 staircase 2"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/3/36/UnderpassKeyWay3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230102205906","c":"Way to the Primorsky 46 staircase 3"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/d3/UnderpassKeyWay4.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230102205319","c":"Primorsky 46 staircase"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.no